<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">RRK21.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">OMUBUURIZI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Ky'Omubuurizi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Omubuurizi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mub</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO</para>
  <para style="mt1">KY'OMUBUURIZI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okurinda orurimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Ebigambo by'Omubuurizi, mwene Daudi, omugabe ow'omuri Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="ECC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:16">Yob 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:5">Zab 39:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 144:4">144:4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:20">Rom 8:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omubuurizi naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:2">Busha erikukira busha yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:2">Byona ni busha!<verse eid="ECC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 3:9">Mub 3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ni mugasho ki ogu omuntu aiha omu kufa kubi kwona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:3">Oku afa kubi ahansi y'eizooba?<verse eid="ECC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:90">Zab 119:90</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obusingye burugaho, obundi bwija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:4">Kwonka ensi yo egumaho obutwire bwona.<verse eid="ECC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:4-6">Zab 19:4-6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba rituruka, kandi rirenga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:5">Bwanyima rirahuka kugaruka ei riruga.<verse eid="ECC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 11:5">Mub 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="JON 3:8">Yon 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuyaga gutoora obukiizi-bwa-buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:6">Gugaruka gutoora obwa-bumosho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:6">Guhindahinduka omu rugyendo rwagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:6">Kandi gugaruka omu kwehinguririza kwagwo.<verse eid="ECC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Emigyera yoona eshuka omu nyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:7">Kwonka enyanja teijura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:7">Ei emigyera eza, niyo egaruka kuza.<verse eid="ECC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 27:20">Enf 27:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebintu byona biijwire oburuhe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:8">Obu omuntu atarikubaasa kushoboorora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:8">Eriisho tirihaaga kureeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:8">N'okutu tikuhaaga kuhurira.<verse eid="ECC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 3:15">Mub 3:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekirabaireho nikyo kiriguma nikibaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:9">Kandi ekirakozirwe nikyo kiriguma nikikorwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:9">Tihariho kisya ahansi y'eizooba.<verse eid="ECC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Hariho eki abantu baakugambaho ngu, Reeba, eki ni kisya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:10">Nakyo kirabaireho ira omu biro ebyatubandiize.<verse eid="ECC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 2:16">Mub 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:5">9:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebya ira tibikiijukwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:11">N'ebiribaho, ebitakabeireho, abarikurataho tibaribiijuka.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwengye nabwo okutagira mugasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Nyowe Omubuurizi nkaba ndi omugabe wa Israeli omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:10">Mub 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:19">Kut 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Nkata omutima aha kusherura n'okucondooza obwengye, ngu mbone kumanya ebirikukorwa ahansi y'eiguru byona; naashanga kuri okufa kubi okw'obusaasi oku Ruhanga yaahaire abantu kubarusya. <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:11">Mub 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 4:4">4:4</ref>. </char></note> Nkeetegyereza byona ebirikukorwa ahansi y'eizooba, naashanga byona biri busha, biri okwitanira omuyaga.<verse eid="ECC 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 7:13">Mub 7:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekikiikami tikirikubaasa kugororwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:15">Kandi ekitahikire tikirikubaasa kubarwa.<verse eid="ECC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 2:9">Mub 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:12">1 Bag 3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naateekateeka omu mutima gwangye nti: Reeba, ngizire obwengye bwingi okukira boona ab'omuri Yerusaalemu abambandiize; omutima gwangye gumazire omwanya muhango nigukoresa obwengye n'okumanya. <verse eid="ECC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:12">Mub 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 7:25">7:25</ref>. </char></note> Naata omutima aha kwetegyereza obwengye n'obugwa-iraro n'obushema; naashanga nabyo kuri okwitanira omuyaga.<verse eid="ECC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Ahakuba obwengye bwingi bubamu enaku nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:18">Kandi oyeyongyera okumanya, ayeyongyera obusaasi.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Obweziriki n'obutungi okutareeta busingye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:19">Luk 12:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nkagira omutima gwangye nti: Ka nkugyeze n'eby'okweshemeza, oshemererwe, ogwe gye. Kwonka ekyo nakyo naashanga kuri okwitanira omuyaga. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 14:13">Enf 14:13</ref>. </char></note> Naagamba aha nsheko nti: N'eiraro! N'aha kweshemeza nti: Nikugasha ki? <verse eid="ECC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Naateekateeka omu mutima gwangye oku naakubaasa kweshemeza na viinyo, omutima gwangye gukaguma nigumpabura obwengye, n'oku naakubaasa kumanya oku abantu bashemereire kutwaza ahansi y'eizooba omu biro ebi bamara omu nsi. <verse eid="ECC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:1-12">1 Bag 7:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 8:11">Kyesh 8:11</ref>. </char></note> Naakora emirimo mikuru; naayeyombekyera amaju, naayebyarira emizaabibu, <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="SNG 4:16">Kyesh 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 5:1">5:1</ref>. </char></note> naayehingira emisiri, naayekorera ebibanja, naabibyaramu emiti erikwana ebijuma, <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />naayecungirira ebiyanja, naataho emikura y'okutwara amaizi omu misiri ey'okwororeramu emiti. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:14">Kut 14:14</ref>. </char></note> Naagura abahuuku n'abazaana, n'abandi baazaarirwa omu ka yangye; kandi naagira amasyo maingi g'ente n'ag'entaama, agarikukira ag'abandi boona abambandiize omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:21">1 Bag 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:28">9:28</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 10:15">10:15</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:3">11:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:25">2 Bus 35:25</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naayerundaanira efeeza n'ezaabu, n'eby'eitungo eby'abagabe n'eby'amashaza; naayetungira abeeshongozi abashaija n'abakazi, n'ebinyanshunju bingi ebirikushemeza abantu.<verse eid="ECC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 1:16">Mub 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:25">1 Bus 29:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ntyo naaba mukuru, naakira boona abambandiize omuri Yerusaalemu, kandi n'obwengye bwangye naaguma nabwo. <verse eid="ECC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:22">Mub 3:22</ref>. </char></note> Eki amaisho gangye gaabaire geetenga kyona, nkaba ntakigaima; nkaba ntazibira mutima gwangye kweshemeza omu muringo gwona, ahakuba nkashemerererwa okufa kubi kwangye kwona; ebyo nibyo byabaire ebihembo byakwo. <verse eid="ECC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:3">Mub 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 1:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naayetegyereza ebi naakozire n'emikono yangye byona, n'okufa kubi oku naafiire kubi nimbikora, naashanga byona biri busha, biri okwitanira omuyaga, kandi hataine kiine omugasho ahansi y'eizooba.<verse eid="ECC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 1:9">Mub 1:9</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 1:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ntyo naagaruka naareeba obwengye n'obugwa-iraro n'obushema; mbwenu ekindi eki ohungurira omugabe yaakukora niki? Kureka ebibaire byakozirwe. <verse eid="ECC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Bwanyima naareeba ku obwengye burikukira obushema, nk'oku omushana gukira omwirima. <verse eid="ECC 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 9:2">Mub 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 17:24">Enf 17:24</ref>. </char></note> Omunyabwengye agira amaisho, kwonka omushema agyendera omu mwirima ataine ki arikureeba; n'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, nkeetegyereza ngu omuheru gwabo boona guba gumwe. <verse eid="ECC 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Nikwo kuteekateeka omu mutima gwangye nti: Ebihika aha mushema, naanye nibyo birimpikaho. Mbwenu shi, okumukiza obwengye nikingasira ki? Ntyo naagira omu mutima gwangye nti: Ekyo nakyo ni busha. <verse eid="ECC 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:11">Mub 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Manya, omunyabwengye n'omushema nikyo kimwe; tihariho origuma naijukwa, ahabw'okuba omu biro ebiriija bombi baryaba baayebire. Ka n'eihano omunyabwengye kufa nk'omushema! <verse eid="ECC 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Ntyo naatamwa amagara, ahabw'okuba ebikorerwa ahansi y'eizooba byona bikangwisa kubi; byona ni busha n'okwitanira omuyaga.<verse eid="ECC 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 39:6">Zab 39:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 49:10">49:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naatamwa ebi naafeereire kubi byona ahansi y'eizooba, ahabw'okureeba ngu ndyabitsigira orimpungurira. <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:13">1 Bag 12:13</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 12:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu n'oha orikumanya yaaba ariba omunyabwengye nari omushema? Kwonka niwe ariba mukama wa byona ebi naafeereire kubi ninkoresa obwengye bwangye ahansi y'eizooba. Ekyo nakyo ni busha. <verse eid="ECC 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Nikyo naahindukiire, omutima gwangye nkagumara amatsiko aha bi naafeereire kubi byona ahansi y'eizooba; <verse eid="ECC 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />ahakuba obundi hariho omuntu okora n'obwengye n'okumanya n'obuhangu; kwonka aryabitsigira otarabihendekyeire, abigaramisirizemu. Ekyo nakyo ni busha, n'ekibi kihango. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:3">Mub 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu shi, omuntu aiha ki omu kufa kubi kwe kwona, n'omu bi omutima gwe gwayezirikiire kukora hansi y'eizooba? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:13">Mub 1:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:7">Yob 5:7</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ebiro bye byona biijwire obusaasi, n'okukora kwe n'enaku; nangwa na nyekiro omutima gwe tiguruhuuka. Ekyo nakyo ni busha.<verse eid="ECC 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 5:18">Mub 5:18</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 5:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:7">9:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihariho kigasira omuntu ekikira okurya n'okunywa n'okutunga okushemererwa omu bi afeereire kubi. Ekyo nakyo nkareeba ku kiruga omu mikono ya Ruhanga; <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />mbwenu We ah'atari n'oha orikubaasa kurya nari kweshemeza? <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:16">Yob 27:16</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 27:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 32:8">32:8</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba omuntu oshemeza Ruhanga niwe aha obwengye n'okumanya n'okushemererwa; kwonka omusiisi Ruhanga amuha omurimo gw'okushaaruura n'okuhunika, ngu abone kubitsigira omuntu orikushemeza Ruhanga. Ekyo nakyo ni busha, n'okwitanira omuyaga.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuteekateekyera ekintu kyona obunaku bwakyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 8:6">Mub 8:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buri kintu kiine ebiro byakyo, kandi ekyatairweho ahansi y'eiguru kyona kiine obunaku bwakyo:<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:5">Yob 14:5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:27">Heb 9:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obunaku bw'okuzaarwa, n'obunaku bw'okufa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:2">Obunaku bw'okubyara, n'obunaku bw'okukuura ebyabyairwe;<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />Obunaku bw'okwita, n'obunaku bw'okukiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:3">Obunaku bw'okusheenya, n'obunaku bw'okwombeka;<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:20">Kur 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 6:14">2 Sam 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:15">Rom 12:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obunaku bw'okurira, n'obunaku bw'okusheka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:4">Obunaku bw'okucura, n'obunaku bw'okuzina;<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 3:25">2 Bag 3:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:2">Isa 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:16">Yoel 2:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obunaku bw'okunaga amabaare, n'obunaku bw'okugarunda hamwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:5">Obunaku bw'okufumbatana, n'obunaku bw'okwerinda kufumbatana;<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />Obunaku bw'okusherura, n'obunaku bw'okubuza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:6">Obunaku bw'okubiika, n'obunaku bw'okunaga;<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 5:13">Amo 5:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obunaku bw'okutaagura, n'obunaku bw'okubaziira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:7">Obunaku bw'okuhunama, n'obunaku bw'okugamba;<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 14:26">Luk 14:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obunaku bw'okukunda, n'obunaku bw'okwanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:8">Obunaku bw'obweme, n'obunaku bw'obusingye.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 1:3">Mub 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu omukozi atunga magoba ki omu bi ahendekyeire?<verse eid="ECC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 1:13">Mub 1:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkareeba emirimo ei Ruhanga yaahaire abantu kukora. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 8:17">Mub 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 1:31">Kut 1:31</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:33">Rom 11:33</ref>. </char></note> Buri kintu akakihanga kiri kirungi omu bunaku bwakyo; kandi yaata omu mitima y'abantu ebiteekateeko by'obunaku obutarihwaho, n'obu omuntu araabe atarikubaasa kumanya ebi Ruhanga yaakozire okwiha aha kutandika okuhitsya aha muheru. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Nimmanya ku hatariho kirikubakiriira okushemererwa n'okukora gye ebiro byona ebi bariba bakiriho; <verse eid="ECC 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:24">Mub 2:24</ref>. </char></note> kandi ku kiri ekiconco kya Ruhanga aha muntu weena okurya n'okunywa n'okushemerererwa ebi arikufeera kubi byona. <verse eid="ECC 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:17">Yak 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Nimmanya ngu, eki Ruhanga akora kyona kiryagumaho ebiro byona; tihaine kirikubaasa kukyongyerwaho, nari okukituubyaho; kandi Ruhanga akakihanga atyo, ngu abantu bamutiine. <verse eid="ECC 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:9">Mub 1:9</ref>. </char></note> Ekiriho kirabaireho; ekiribaho nakyo kirabaireho; kandi Ruhanga agaruraho ekyabaire kihirweho.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 4:1">Mub 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 5:8">5:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nkareeba ahansi y'eizooba, omu mwanya gw'okucweramu emanja z'oburyo, harimu obubi; kandi omu mwanya ogwabaire gurimu okuhikiirira, harimu obubi. <verse eid="ECC 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:1">Mub 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Kor 5:10</ref>. </char></note> Nikwo kugira omu mutima gwangye nti: Ruhanga aryacwera abahikiriire n'ababi orubanja; ahabw'okuba buri kintu na buri murimo akabiteeraho obunaku bwabyo. <verse eid="ECC 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Kandi naagira omu mutima gwangye nti: Ruhanga naagyeza abaana b'abantu, ngu babone kumanyiraho ku batari kindi kureka enyamaishwa. <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 49:12">Zab 49:12</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ekihika aha bantu, nikyo kihika aha nyamaishwa; nk'oku omuntu afa, nikwo n'enyamaishwa efa. Byona bigira emiikize emwe; omuntu taine ki akiza enyamaishwa, ahabw'okuba byona ni busha. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:19">Kut 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Byona biza omu mwanya gumwe; byona bikaruga omu mucuucu, kandi byona nimwo birigaruka. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 12:7">Mub 12:7</ref>. </char></note> N'oha orikumanya yaaba omwitsyo gw'omuntu gwinamuka ahaiguru, ogw'enyamaishwa gukashuuma omu itaka? <verse eid="ECC 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:10">Mub 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 10:14">10:14</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo ndikureebera ngu tihariho kirikukirira omuntu okushemerererwa emirimo ye, ahabw'okuba ogwo nigwo mugabo gwe. N'oha owaakumugarura kureeba ebiribaho yaarugireho?<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ebibi n'enaku z'omu nsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 3:16">Mub 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:2">Tonz 1:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nkagaruka naareeba eby'okuhata byona ebirikukorerwa ahansi y'eizooba. Naareeba okurira okw'abarikuhatwa bataine kihuumuriza; obushoboorozi bwinwe abo abarikubaita kubi, kandi bataine w'okubahuumuriza. <verse eid="ECC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:17">Yob 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Naateekateeka nti, abafu abaafiire bahiiriirwe okukira abahuriire abakiriho; <verse eid="ECC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 6:3">Mub 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 3:16">Yob 3:16</ref>. </char></note> kwonka orikubakira bombi n'otakabahoga, kandi otakareebaga bibi ebirikukorwa ahansi y'eizooba.<verse eid="ECC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Bwanyima naareeba emirabanamu yoona y'eby'emirimo y'obuhangu byona, ku nibyo bireetera omuntu okugirirwa mutaahi we eihari. Kandi ekyo nakyo ni busha n'okwitanira omuyaga.<verse eid="ECC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 6:10">Enf 6:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushema ayefumbata, atsigarira okwerya.<verse eid="ECC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 15:16">Enf 15:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oruhi rumwe rwijwire obusingye niruhita empi ibiri eziijwire emirabanamu n'okwitanira omuyaga.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Kandi hoona nkagaruka naareeba busha ahansi y'eizooba; <verse eid="ECC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:8">Mub 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 2:18">2:18</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 27:20">Enf 27:20</ref>. </char></note> omuntu otaine waabo, n'obu yaakuba omutabani, nari mwene ishe; kwonka okufa kubi kwe kutaine bugarukiro, kandi amaisho ge gatakahaagaga butungi, haza atakeebuuzaga ati: Beitu obu nfa kubi nti, mpendekyera ki ekinzibira kweshemeza? Ekyo nakyo ni busha n'emirabanamu mibi.<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Ababiri nibakira omwe; ahabw'okuba baheebwa ebihembo birungi ahabw'okufa kubi kwabo. <verse eid="ECC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Ahakuba ku bagwa, omwe aimutsya mugyenzi we; kwonka ogwa ari omwe wenka, akabura kiimutsya, areeba enaku. <verse eid="ECC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Ekindi, ababiri ku babyama hamwe, batagatirwa; mbwenu omwe naabaasa ata kutagatirwa ari wenka? <verse eid="ECC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Omuntu n'obu yaakusingura omwe, ababiri takaababaasa; kandi omurunga gw'enyabushatu tigucweka juba.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 9:15">Mub 9:15</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 9:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 12:12">12:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutsigazi omworo ow'obwengye naakira omugabe okuzire omushema, otakyenda kuhaburwa; <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:14">Kut 41:14</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 41:41-43">41-43</ref>. </char></note> n'obu yaakuba yaarugire omu kihome akaza aha ngoma, nari yaazairwe ari omworo omu ihanga rye. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Nkareeba abantu boona abahuriire abarikugyendagyenda ahansi y'eizooba, beemereire aha rubaju rw'ogwo mutsigazi owaabaire naazakuhungurira ogwo mugabe; <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />abantu abu yaabaire naategyeka bakaba bari baingi bataine bugarukiro. Kwonka abarikurataho tibarimushemerererwa. Buzimazima ekyo nakyo ni busha n'okwitanira omuyaga.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:5">Kur 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:22">1 Sam 15:22</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:8">Enf 15:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oriba nooza omu nju ya Ruhanga, ogume orinde ekigyere kyawe; okwirira haihi kuhurira nikukira okutamba ebitambo by'abashema, ahabw'okuba bo tibamanya ku barikukora kubi. <verse eid="ECC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:7">Mat 6:7</ref>. </char></note> Otarirahukwa aha rurimi, kandi otariikiriza omutima gwawe kurahukiriza kurahira omu maisho ga Ruhanga; ahabw'okuba Ruhanga ari omu iguru, naiwe ori aha nsi; n'ahabw'ekyo ebigambo byawe bibe bikye. <verse eid="ECC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Ahabw'okuba ebirooto bireetwa emirabanamu mingi, kandi eiraka ry'omushema rimanyirwa aha bigambo bingi.<verse eid="ECC 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Kub 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Bir 23:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:14">Zab 50:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 66:13">66:13</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 66:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku orirahira nooraganisa ahari Ruhanga, otarikyerererwa kukihikiirirza; ahabw'okuba tashemerererwa bashema. Ogume ohikiirize eki oraganiise. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:25">Enf 20:25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 5:4">Byak 5:4</ref>. </char></note> Okuraganisa otahikiirize nikikirwa okutaraganisa. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Otariikiriza akanwa kaawe kukucumuza, kandi otarigamba omu maisho ga maraika oti: Kikaba kiri ekishobyo. Nooyendera ki ku Ruhanga agirira eiraka ryawe ekiniga, akacwekyereza emirimo y'emikono yaawe?<verse eid="ECC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 12:13">Mub 12:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manya, ebirooto ku bikanya, n'ebigambo bitaine muhoho bikanya; kwonka iwe ogume otiine Ruhanga.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku obutungi bushemereire kukoresibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 3:16">Mub 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 12:5">Zab 12:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku orireeba omu ishaza abooro nibahatwa, emanja zaabo niziitwa, kandi nibaakwa n'amaani ebi bashemereire, otaritangaara; ahakuba orikukiza abakuru obukuru aryaba naabireeba; kandi hariho orikubakirira kimwe. <verse eid="ECC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Kwonka omweru gw'ensi guba ogwa boona; n'omugabe atungwa ebi ahingiirwe.<verse eid="ECC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Okunda efeeza tahaaga feeza; kandi n'okunda obutungi tahaaga magoba. Ekyo nakyo ni busha.<verse eid="ECC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Ebintu ku bikanya, n'ab'okubirya bakanya; mbwenu nyinabyo aba ayeyongyeireho ki? Tokubireeba n'amaisho kwonka? <verse eid="ECC 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Oturo tw'omukozi tumugwa gye, n'obu arya bikye nari bingi; kwonka omwiguto gw'omutungi gumubuza oturo.<verse eid="ECC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Hariho ekibi ekirengyesereize eki naareebire ahansi y'eizooba; nibwo butungi obu omuntu ayeebiikira, haza bukamureetera akabi; <verse eid="ECC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />obutungi bwe obwo bukamarwaho ebihikiirizi; kandi akizaara omwana, akabura eky'okumuha. <verse eid="ECC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21">Yob 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:7">1 Tim 6:7</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku yaarugire omunda ya nyina ataine ki ajwaire, nikwo arigyenda ataine ki aihire omu kufa kubi kwe, ekiyaakutwara omu ngaro ze. <verse eid="ECC 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:3">Mub 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 11:29">Enf 11:29</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekyo nakyo n'ekibi ekirengyesereize; oku yaizire, nikwo arigyenda. Mbwenu nikimugasira ki okwitanira omuyaga, <verse eid="ECC 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />akamara ebiro bye byona ari omu mwirima, aine enaku nyingi n'endwara n'okwetomboita? <verse eid="ECC 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:10">Mub 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 2:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, eki naareebire kiri kirungi aha muntu, kandi kihikire, n'okurya n'okunywa n'okushemerererwa okufa kubi kwe ebiro bikye ebi Ruhanga amuhaire; ahabw'okuba ogwo nigwo mugabo gwe. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:13">Mub 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 6:2">6:2</ref>. </char></note> N'omuntu weena ou Ruhanga ahaire eitungo n'ebintu n'obushoboorozi bw'okubishemerererwa omu kufa kubi kwe, ekyo nakyo n'ekiconco kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Ahakuba taritongyeza munonga biro by'amagara ge, ahabw'okuba Ruhanga aryaguma naamuhuzya n'okushemererwa omu mutima gwe, naabimwebesa.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="s1">Omuheru gw'ebintu byona n'okufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 5:13">Mub 5:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho ekibi eki naareebire ahansi y'eizooba, kandi ekituura kiremereire abantu, <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:13">1 Bag 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:19">Luk 12:19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:20">20</ref>. </char></note> niwe muntu ou Ruhanga ahaire eitungo n'ebintu n'ekitiinisa, ataine kintu kyona eki arikwetenga, kwonka akamwima okubishemerererwamu, kureka omunyaihanga akaba niwe yaabishemerererwamu. Ekyo nakyo ni busha, kandi n'okubonabona kw'obusaasi. <verse eid="ECC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 4:3">Mub 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:35">2 Bag 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:19">Isa 14:19</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 14:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:19">Yer 22:19</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu okuzaara abaana igana, akahangaara emyaka mingi, ebiro by'amagara ge bikakanya, kwonka omutima gwe gutahaagye birungi, akabura kiziika, ningira ngu omuntu ogwo naakirwa enda erugiremu; <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />ahakuba egyo nda erugamu etari kintu, eza omu mwirima, gushweka eiziina ryayo, <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />kandi eba etakareebaga izooba n'obu kwakuba okumanya ekintu kyona; n'obu eraabe eba etyo, etunga obuhuumure okukira ogwo muntu. <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />N'obu yaakuhangaara emyaka rukumi kabiri, atarikushemerererwa birungi, timurikumanya ngu byona biza omu mwanya gumwe?<verse eid="ECC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 16:26">Enf 16:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okufa kubi kwona oku omuntu afa kubi, aba naahendekyera enda ye, kwonka tahaaga. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:15">Mub 2:15</ref>. </char></note> Omunyabwengye naakiza ki omushema? Kandi omworo naakiza ki omuntu mukuru orikumanya kutwaza gye omu maisho g'abantu? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Okushemerererwa ebi orikureeba nikikira okuguma noozengyereza omutima aha bi orikwetenga. Ekyo nakyo ni busha n'okwitanira omuyaga.<verse eid="ECC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 1:10">Mub 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:32">Yob 9:32</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">Isa 45:9</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:22">1 Kor 10:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekiriho kyona kikeetwa eiziina ira; oku omuntu ari hati kukamanywa ira, kandi tarikubaasa kuhakanisa Orikumukiza amaani. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Ebigambo ku byongyera kukanya, busha nayo ekanya; mbwenu ekyo omuntu kimwongyeraho ki? <verse eid="ECC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:22">Mub 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 8:13">8:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 14:2">Yob 14:2</ref>. </char></note> N'oha owaakumanya ebishemereire kugirira omuntu omugasho akiriho ebiro byona eby'amagara ge agataine ku gari, agarikuhinguraho nk'ekicuucu? N'oha owaakugambira omuntu ebiribaho ahansi y'eizooba yaarugireho?<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ezindi nfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 4:2">Mub 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 22:1">Enf 22:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okugira eiziina rirungi nikikira amajuta g'omugaju ag'obuguzi bwingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:1">Eizooba ey'okufeeraho nirikira ery'okuzaarirwaho.<verse eid="ECC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Okuza omu ka erimu okucura</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:2">Nikikira okuza omu ka erimu obugyenyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:2">Ahabw'okuba ekyo nigwo muheru gw'abantu bona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:2">Kandi abahuriire baryakigumya aha mutima.<verse eid="ECC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 7:10">2 Kor 7:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Entimba y'aha mutima ekira ensheko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:3">Ahabw'okuba enaku z'ahamaisho zishemeza omutima.<verse eid="ECC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Omutima gw'omunyabwengye guba omu nju ei barikucuriramu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:4">Kwonka emitima y'abashema eba omu nju y'okwesiima.<verse eid="ECC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 141:5">Zab 141:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haakiri omuntu okuhurira okuhana kw'abanyabwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:5">Okukira okuhurira ekyeshongoro ky'abashema;<verse eid="ECC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Ahakuba okusheka kw'omushema ni nk'amahwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:6">Agarikubarabarukira ahansi y'enyungu eteeka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:6">Ekyo nakyo ni busha.<verse eid="ECC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:8">Kur 23:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima okuhata kuhindura omunyabwengye omushema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:7">Kandi enguzi eita obwengye.<verse eid="ECC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Omuheru gw'ekintu gukira okutandika kwakyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:8">Ow'omutima ogurikugumisiriza akira ow'omutima gw'amaryo.<verse eid="ECC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 14:17">Enf 14:17</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 14:29">29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarirahuka kugira ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:9">Ahabw'okuba ekiniga kituura omu mutima gw'abashema.<verse eid="ECC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />Otagira oti: Ahabw'enki ebiro bya ira nibihita ebya hati?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:10">Ahabw'okuba obwengye tibwo burikukureetera kubuuza otyo.<verse eid="ECC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Obwengye ni burungi waaba oine obuhunguzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:11">Kandi nibugasira abakirikureeba eizooba.<verse eid="ECC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:18">Enf 3:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba obwengye n'obweshereko, nk'oku empiiha ziba obweshereko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:12">Kandi omugasho gw'okumanya n'obwengye bw'okurinda amagara g'obwine.<verse eid="ECC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 1:15">Mub 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 3:11">3:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:27">Isa 14:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yetegyereze omurimo gwa Ruhanga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:13">N'oha owaakubaasa kugorora eki yaakiikamize?<verse eid="ECC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Aha izooba ery'okuhiirwa, oshemererwe; n'aha izooba ry'akabi oteekateekye ku Ruhanga niwe yaabihangire byombi, ngu omuntu atarimanya ebiribaho atakiriho.<verse eid="ECC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 6:12">Mub 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 8:12-14">8:12-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo byona nkabireeba omu biro by'amagara gangye g'enfabusha; hariho ohikiriire ofa ahabw'okuhikiirira kwe, kandi hariho omubi ohangaara ahabw'obubi bwe. <verse eid="ECC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Rom 12:3</ref>. </char></note> Otarengyesereza okuhikiirira, kandi oteehindura omunyabwengye orengyesereize. Nooyendera ki kwereetera okufa? <verse eid="ECC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:32">Yob 15:32</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 10:27">Enf 10:27</ref>. </char></note> Otarengyesereza kuba mubi, kandi otaba omushema. Nooyendera ki kufa obunaku bwawe butakahikire? <verse eid="ECC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Ni kirungi okuhamyaho kimwe, n'ekindi okutakireka; ahabw'okuba orikutiina Ruhanga aryaruga gye omuri ebyo byona.<verse eid="ECC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 9:16">Mub 9:16</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 9:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 21:22">Enf 21:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwengye bureetera omunyabwengye amaani okukira abategyeki ikumi abari omu rurembo. <verse eid="ECC 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:46">1 Bag 8:46</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:23">Rom 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:8">1 Yoh 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima tihariho ohikiriire omu nsi okora gye, atashiishe na kakye. <verse eid="ECC 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Kandi otarita omutima aha bigambo by'abantu, nyentsya otakaahurira omuhuuku waawe naakujuma; <verse eid="ECC 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />ahakuba naiwe noomanya omu mutima gwawe kaingi ku okyeena abandi.<verse eid="ECC 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Ebyo byona nkabihamya ahabw'obwengye. Nkagira nti: Ndyaba omunyabwengye, kwonka bwamba hare. <verse eid="ECC 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 28:12">Yob 28:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:33">Rom 11:33</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:16">1 Tim 6:16</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kiri hare munonga okuzimu; n'oha owaakubaasa kukizoora? <verse eid="ECC 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Bwanyima naahinduka, naamariirira omu mutima gwangye kumanya, kucondooza, kusherura obwengye, kwehanuuza ebintu, n'okumanya obubi bw'obushema, n'obushema oku buri eiraro. <verse eid="ECC 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 5:4">Enf 5:4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 22:14">22:14</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 23:28">23:28</ref>. </char></note> Naagaruka naareeba ekintu ekirikukira rufu obushaarizi, niwe mukazi ou omutima gwe guri omutego n'ekigoye, kandi n'emikono ye eri enkomo. Orikushemeza Ruhanga niwe arimukira; kwonka omusiisi, ogwo mukazi aryamukwata. <verse eid="ECC 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Omubuurizi yaagaruka yaagira ati: Reeba, eki nikyo naaboine, ahabw'okuteerana ekintu n'ekindi, ngu ndeebe oku birikwingana, <verse eid="ECC 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:3">1 Bag 11:3</ref>. </char></note> eki omutima gwangye gusherwire kaingi, kwonka eki ntakareebire. Omu bashaija rukumi nkareebamu omwe, kwonka omu bakazi boona tindaboinemu n'omwe. <verse eid="ECC 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Kut 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:6">3:6</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 3:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, eki kyonka nikyo naareebire, ngu Ruhanga akahanga omuntu agororokire, kwonka abantu baayesherurira bingi ebi baayegunziire.<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'obwengye n'okutegyeka okuhikire</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />N'oha ori nk'omunyabwengye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 8:1">Kandi n'oha orikumanya ekintu oku kirikushoboororwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 8:1">Obwengye bw'omuntu bureetera aha maisho ge kushemuuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 8:1">Bumaraho emifunya.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:11">Kur 22:11</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:42">1 Bag 2:42</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:43">43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ninkuhabura, oyorobere ekiragiro ky'omugabe, kandi ahabw'endahiro ei waarahiire ahari Ruhanga otarihahaaza omutima; <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 10:4">Mub 10:4</ref>. </char></note> ruga omu maisho ge, oteeziringa eki yaakuragiira, n'obu kiraabe kitarikukushemeza; ahabw'okuba akora eki arikwenda kyona. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Manya, ekigambo ky'omugabe kigira obushoboorozi. N'oha owaakwehanga kumugira ati: Ekyo nookora ki? <verse eid="ECC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Orikworobera ekiragiro, tarihikwaho kabi; kandi omutima gw'omunyabwengye gumanya obunaku buhikire, n'oburyo bw'okukoreramu; <verse eid="ECC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:1">Mub 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 3:17">17</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba ekintu kyona kigira obunaku bwakyo n'oburyo obu kishemereire kukorwamu, omuntu n'obu araabe ahendwa obusaasi bwe. <verse eid="ECC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 10:14">Mub 10:14</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba tamanya biribaho; mbwenu n'oha owaakubaasa kumugambira oku biriba? <verse eid="ECC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:5">Yob 14:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 49:6">Zab 49:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 49:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho muntu oine obushoboorozi bw'okutegyeka omuyaga, n'obu kwakuba okwemereza eizooba rya rufu; omuri orwo rugamba tihabaho kuraga, kandi owaayehaireyo kukora ebibi, tibirimujuna. <verse eid="ECC 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:13">Mub 1:13</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo byona nkabireeba, obu naata omutima gwangye aha kumanya ebirikukorwa ahansi y'eizooba, omuntu naayekuriza ahari mugyenzi we kumukora kubi.<verse eid="ECC 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Bwanyima nkareeba ababi nibaziikwa, nibaza okuzimu; kwonka abaakozire gye baaruga omu Mwanya ogurikwera, baayeba omu rurembo. Ekyo nakyo ni busha. <verse eid="ECC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:5">Est 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:21">Zab 50:21</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:4">Rom 2:4</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 2:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:9">2 Pet 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'ekifubiro ky'ekibi kutaija juba, nikyo emitima y'abantu emariiririra kukora ebibi. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:15">Mub 7:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:25">Bir 12:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 3:10">Isa 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:20">65:20</ref>. </char></note> Omusiisi n'obu akora ebibi emirundi igana, akahangaara, kwonka nimmanyira kimwe ngu abatuura omu maisho ga Ruhanga nibamutiina nibo bariba gye; <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 6:12">Mub 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 14:2">Yob 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 3:11">Isa 3:11</ref>. </char></note> kwonka omubi we tariba gye, n'obu kwakuba okwongyera aha biro bye ebiri nk'ekicuucu, ahabw'okuba tatiina Ruhanga.<verse eid="ECC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:7">Yob 21:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 73:3">Zab 73:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 73:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:1">Yer 12:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho busha obundi obubaho omu nsi; hariho abahikiriire abahikwaho ebyakushemereire ebi ababi bakora, kandi hariho ababi abahikwaho ebyakushemereire ebi abahikiriire bakora. Nikwo kugira nti: Ekyo nakyo ni busha. <verse eid="ECC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:24">Mub 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naasiima okweruhuura; ahabw'okuba tihariho ekirikukirira omuntu okurya n'okunywa n'okweruhuura; ahakuba ebyo nibyo ariguma nabyo omu kufa kubi kwe ebiro byona ebi Ruhanga amuhaire kumara ahansi y'eizooba.<verse eid="ECC 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Ku naataire omutima aha kumanya obwengye n'okureeba emirabanamu eri aha nsi, (ahabw'okuba hariho abatagwejegyera na kakye nyomushana na nyekiro,) <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:11">Mub 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 73:16">Zab 73:16</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 25:2">Enf 25:2</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima naayetegyereza emirimo ya Ruhanga yoona, naashanga omuntu atarikubaasa kushoborokyerwa murimo gwona ogukorwa ahansi y'eizooba. Omuntu n'obu yaakufa kubi ata kwenda kugumanya, takaagushoborokyerwa; nangwa n'obu omunyabwengye yaakugira ngu naagumanya, kwonka taribaasa kugumanya.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ababi n'abarungi okuhikwaho ebirikushushana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:3">Bir 33:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo byona nkabita aha mutima, naabyetegyereza, abahikiriire n'abanyabwengye n'ebi bakora oku biri omu mikono ya Ruhanga; yaaba biruga ahari rukundo, nari ahari rwango, tihaine orikukimanya. Byona biri aho omu maisho gaabo. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:14">Mub 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:22">Yob 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 5:3">Zek 5:3</ref>. </char></note> Byona bihika ahari boona omu muringo gumwe, ahari ohikiriire n'ahari otahikiriire, aha murungi n'aha mubi, ahari oshemeire n'ahari otashemeire, aha mutambi w'ebitambo n'aha muntu otabitamba. Oku omurungi aba, nikwo n'omusiisi aba; orahira ni nk'otarahira. <verse eid="ECC 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Obwo n'obubi obuba omuri byona ebikorwa ahansi y'eizooba, abantu boona kuhikwaho omuheru gumwe; ekindi, emitima y'abantu eijwire ebibi, kandi n'omu mitima yaabo habamu eiraro bakiriho; bwanyima y'ebyo bakurata abaafiire. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Kwonka okwatanisa n'abahuriire boona aba aine amatsiko, ahabw'okuba embwa ehuriire ekira entare efiire. <verse eid="ECC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:11">Mub 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 14:21">Yob 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:12">Zab 31:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:12">88:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:14">Isa 26:14</ref>. </char></note> Abahuriire bamanya ku barifa; kwonka abafiire tibagira ki bamanya, kandi baba batakiine bindi bihembo; ahabw'okuba tibaakiijukwa. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Okukunda kwabo n'okwangana kwabo n'eihari ryabo, byona biba byahweireho; kandi baba batakiine mugabo gwona omuri byona ebirikukorwa ahansi y'eizooba okuhitsya ebiro byona.<verse eid="ECC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 8:15">Mub 8:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Irooko oyeriire eby'okurya byawe n'okushemererwa, kandi oyenywere viinyo yaawe n'okweruhuura; ahabw'okuba Ruhanga aherize kusiima ebi orikukora. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Ebijwaro byawe bigume nibyera, kandi omutwe gwawe gurekye kuburamu amajuta.<verse eid="ECC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 2:10">Mub 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 7:15">7:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oyesiime n'omukazi waawe ou okunda ebiro byona eby'amagara gaawe agataine muhoho, ebi Ruhanga akuhaire kumara ahansi y'eizooba, ahabw'okuba ogwo nigwo mugabo gwawe omu biro by'amagara gaawe n'omu kufa kubi kwawe oku orikufa kubi ahansi y'eizooba. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:23">Kol 3:23</ref>. </char></note> Kyona eki orikwenda kukora n'emikono yaawe, okikore n'amaani; ahabw'okuba okuzimu ei oriza tihabayo murimo, nari enaama, nari okumanya, n'obu bwakuba obwengye.<verse eid="ECC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:34">1 Bag 22:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:23">Yer 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:14">Amo 2:14</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 2:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naagaruka naareeba ahansi y'eizooba ngu abairuki rugambwa tibo basinga omu mpaka z'okwiruka, n'ab'amaani tibo basingura omu rugamba, n'ab'obwengye tibo batunga eby'okurya, n'abarikwegyereza tibo bagira eitungo, n'abahangu tibo bashongoka; kureka boona bahikwaho obunaku n'ebihikiirizi. <verse eid="ECC 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 8:7">Mub 8:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 7:23">Enf 7:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:34-35">Luk 21:34-35</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:3">1 Tes 5:3</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba tihariho muntu omanya obunaku bwe; nk'oku eby'enyanja bikwatwa akatimba kabi, n'enyonyi zikakwatwa omutego, nikwo n'abantu bakwatwa omutego omu bunaku bubi, ku bubagwaho kitaraariire. <verse eid="ECC 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Kandi naareeba ahansi y'eizooba eky'okureeberaho eki eky'obwengye ekyansusiire kikuru. <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14, 15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:15">2 Sam 20:15</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 20:16">16</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 20:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Omu rurembo rukye hakaba harimu abantu bakye; bwanyima omugabe rugambwa yaija, yaarugota, yaarwombekaho ebigo bihango. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />Kwonka omuri orwo rurembo hakaba harimu omworo oine obwengye; bwanyima ahabw'obwengye bwe yaarukiza. N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, tihaine muntu weena owaijukire ogwo mworo. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:19">Mub 7:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:2">Mak 6:2</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naagira nti: Obwengye bukira amaani; kwonka obwengye bw'omworo bugaywa, kandi ebigambo bye tibabyetaho.<verse eid="ECC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Ebigambo by'omunyabwengye ebirikugambwa mpora nibikira ebi omutegyeki orikuyombera omu bashema. <verse eid="ECC 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1">Yos 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:21">2 Bag 17:21</ref>. </char></note> Obwengye nibukira eby'okurwanisa, kwonka omusiisi omwe aita ebirungi bingi.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="s1">Obwengye n'obushema</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Enshohera ezifiire zinuutsya amajuta g'omugaju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:1">N'obushema bukye bumaraho obwengye n'ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ECC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Omutima gw'omunyabwengye gumutooza ahari buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:2">Kwonka ogw'omushema gumutooza ahari bumosho.<verse eid="ECC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 13:16">Enf 13:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haza kandi omushema ku aba ari omu muhanda, aburwa obwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:3">Ou yaareeba weena amweta omushema.<verse eid="ECC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 8:3">Mub 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 25:15">Enf 25:15</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 25:24">1 Sam 25:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutegyeki ku arikugirira ekiniga, otariruga omu mwanya gwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:4">Ahabw'okuba okworoba kusaasiza ebicumuro bihango.<verse eid="ECC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Kandi hariho ekibi eki naareebire ahansi y'eizooba, nikwo kushobaya kw'omutegyeki. <verse eid="ECC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />Obushema buteebwa omu myanya mingi y'ekitiinisa, n'abatungi bashutama omu myanya erikugaywa. <verse eid="ECC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 19:10">Enf 19:10</ref>. </char></note> Nkareeba abahuuku nibagyendera aha mbaraasi, n'abanyiginya nibagyendesa ebigyere nk'abahuuku.<verse eid="ECC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:15">Zab 7:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikutimba ekiina aryakigwamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:8">Kandi orikufumura orugo aryariibwa enjoka.<verse eid="ECC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Ohigura amabaare, gamuhutaaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:9">N'oyatsa enku zimunaga omu kabi.<verse eid="ECC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Ekyoma ku kihwa obwogi, nyinakyo ataakityaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:10">Aba ashemereire kwongyera amaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:10">Kwonka obwengye nibwo buhwera omuntu okuhikiiriza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:10">Eki arikwenda kukora.<verse eid="ECC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:17">Yer 8:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enjoka ku eruma omuntu etarogirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:11">Omurogi waayo aba atakiine mugasho.<verse eid="ECC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Ebigambo ebiruga omu kanwa k'omunyabwengye bimureetera okukundwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:12">Kwonka ebigambo by'omushema biryamumaraho.<verse eid="ECC 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Okutandika kw'ebigambo ebiruga omu kanwa ke n'obushema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:13">N'omuheru gwabyo n'eiraro ribi.<verse eid="ECC 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 6:12">Mub 6:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushema ayongyerera ebigambo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:14">N'obu haraabe hataine orikumanya ebiribaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:14">Kandi n'oha owaakubaasa kumugambira ebiribaho yaarugireho?<verse eid="ECC 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Okufa kubi kw'omushema kumurusya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:15">Ahabw'okuba tamanya kahanda kaza obukama.<verse eid="ECC 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 3:4">Isa 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:11">5:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe nsi 'we, oryareeba enaku, omugabe waawe ku araabe akiri muto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:16">N'abanyiginya baawe nibaimukira aha by'okurya!<verse eid="ECC 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 31:4">Enf 31:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe nsi 'we, ohiiriirwe, omugabe waawe ku araabe ari ow'omu ruganda rw'abakungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:17">Kandi abanyiginya baawe ku baraagume nibariira omu bunaku buhikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:17">Nibariira amaani, batarikunywera sindo!<verse eid="ECC 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Obweremwa bubonza orukanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:18">Kandi emikono emyeremwa ereetera enju kwogwamu enjura.<verse eid="ECC 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:15">Zab 104:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obugyenyi buteekyerwa okusheka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:19">Na viinyo ereetera amagara kushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:19">Kandi empiiha ekyenuura byona.<verse eid="ECC 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kur 22:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarikyeena omugabe, nangwa n'omu biteekateeko byawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:20">Otarijumira abatungi omu kishengye kyawe eki oraaramu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:20">Ahabw'okuba enyonyi y'omu mwanya eryatwara eiraka ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:20">Nari ekiine amapapa kyona kibigambe.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s1">Okukora gye tukiine omwanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 15:10">Bir 15:10</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 19:17">Enf 19:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mat 10:42</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 9:6">2 Kor 9:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mamagiza embibo zaawe aha maizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:1">Bwanyima y'ebiro bingi oryazireeba.<verse eid="ECC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 112:9">Zab 112:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:30">Luk 6:30</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:16">Efe 5:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ha abantu mushanju nari munaana omugabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:2">Ahabw'okuba torikumanya kabi akaribaho omu nsi.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Ebicu ku biba biijwire enjura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:3">Esheesheka aha nsi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:3">Kandi ekiti ku kigwa nikireeba obukiizi-bwa-buryo nari obwa-bumosho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:3">Ahu kigwa, niho kiguma.<verse eid="ECC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Ohanga amaisho omuyaga, tabiba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:4">Kandi ogahanga ebicu, tagyesha.<verse eid="ECC 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 139:15">Zab 139:15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:8">Yoh 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku otarikumanya muhanda gw'omuyaga, nari oku amagufa gakurira omunda y'oine enda, nikwo otarikumanya murimo gwa Ruhanga okora byona. <verse eid="ECC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Omu kasheeshe ogume obibe embibo, kandi n'omu mwabazyo orekye kugwisa omukono; ahabw'okuba torikumanya ekiryera, yaaba eki nari kiriya, nari shi yaaba byombi biriba birungi.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Buzimazima omushana ni murungi, n'okureeba eizooba kushemeza amaisho. <verse eid="ECC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:23">Mub 2:23</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ku araahangaare emyaka mingi, agishemerererwemu yoona; kwonka amanye ngu ebiro by'omwirima biryaba bingi. Ebiribaho byona ni busha.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuhuguura abatsigazi n'empangare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 2:10">Mub 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:7">9:7</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 12:14">12:14</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:39">Kub 15:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe mutsigazi 'we, shemerererwa obutsigazi bwawe, kandi omutima gwawe gugume gunanukye omu biro by'okunyeeta kwawe. Gyendera omu mihanda ei omutima gwawe gurikukunda, nk'oku amaisho gaawe garikureeba. Kwonka omanye ngu ahabw'ebyo byona Ruhanga aryakucwera orubanja. <verse eid="ECC 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:1">2 Kor 7:1</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo iha amaganya omu mutima gwawe, kandi omubiri gwawe ogutaanisa n'ebibi; ahabw'okuba obuto n'obutsigazi ni busha.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1, 2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 19:35">2 Sam 19:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ogume oijukye Omuhangi waawe omu biro by'obutsigazi bwawe, ebiro bibi bitakaizire, n'emyaka etakahikire ei origiriramu oti: Tinkigishemerererwamu, <verse eid="ECC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />eizooba n'omushana n'okwezi n'enyonyoozi bitakashwekirwe mwirima, kandi n'ebicu bitakagarukire enjura yaatsya; <verse eid="ECC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:1">Kut 27:1</ref>. </char></note> obunaku obu abarinzi b'enju baritetema, n'emanzi zikabundabunda, abasi bakarereera ahabw'okuba bakye, n'abarikuringuririza omu dirisa amaisho gakagiibwaho oruho; <verse eid="ECC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:8">Mub 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 141:3">Zab 141:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:10">Yer 25:10</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:5">Mik 7:5</ref>. </char></note> enyigi ezirikureeba omu nguuto zikakingwa, okugamba kw'emengo kukaba kukye, omuntu akasisiimurwa eiraka ry'enyonyi, kandi n'abaishiki boona abeeshongozi bakagarurwa ahansi; <verse eid="ECC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 17:13">Yob 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 26:13">Enf 26:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:17">Yer 9:17</ref>. </char></note> baryatiina ekiri ahaiguru, kandi ebirikutiinisa biryaba biri omu muhanda; omurozi guryarabya, eseeneene ziryarusya, n'ebirikwetengwa biryahwaho, ahabw'okuba omuntu aryaba naaza omu ka y'entuura, n'abarikucura nibazengyerera omu nguuto; <verse eid="ECC 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Zek 4:2</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 4:3">3</ref>. </char></note> akagoye k'efeeza katakacwekire, orwabya rw'ezaabu rutakaatikire, enyungu etakaatikiire ha nshuro, enziga etakahendekyeire ha iziba, <verse eid="ECC 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:20">Mub 3:20</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 3:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:7">Kut 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:19">3:19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:1">Zek 12:1</ref>. </char></note> omucuucu gukagaruka omu itaka, nk'oku gwabaire guri, n'amagara gakagaruka ahari Ruhanga owaagahaire. <verse eid="ECC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:2">Mub 1:2</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Omubuurizi yaagaruka yaagira ati: Ni busha bwa busha; byona ni busha!<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugasho gw'okutiina Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 4:32">1 Bag 4:32</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:1">Enf 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima kandi Omubuurizi, ahabw'okuba omunyabwengye, yaagumizamu kwegyesa abantu okumanya; yaateekateeka enfumu nyingi, yaazeetegyereza, yaazitebeekanisa. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Kandi Omubuurizi yaasherura ebigambo ebirikushemeza, yaahandiika ebigambo by'amazima n'omutima gugororokire. <verse eid="ECC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:23">Isa 22:23</ref>. </char></note> Ebigambo by'abanyabwengye ni nk'emihunda, kandi ebigambo by'Omuriisa omwe ebiteerainwe hamwe ni nk'emisumaari ehamire. <verse eid="ECC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Kandi mwana wangye, oyerinde ekintu kyona ekitari ebyo. Okuhandiika ebitabo bingi tikugira bugarukiro, n'okwega munonga kurusya.<verse eid="ECC 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:12">Bir 10:12</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 10:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo kuhendera ebigambo; ahabw'okuba byona bikahurirwa. Tiina Ruhanga, oyorobere ebiragiro bye; ahakuba ekyo kyonka nikyo omuntu ashemereire kukora; <verse eid="ECC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:17">Mub 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 11:9">11:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:36">Mat 12:36</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba Ruhanga aryacwera orubanja ekintu kyona ekyakozirwe, n'ekintu kyona ekyasherekirwe, yaaba kirungi nari kibi.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>